{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>There is no princess to save, nor dragon to slay. You are, Just a Ball.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to a cozy, physics-based 3D platformer where movement is everything and everything is made of spheres. In a serene and stylized world, you control a ball with a suite of satisfying abilities: roll, sprint, jump, dash, and unleash a powerful &quot;gravity boost&quot; to navigate intricate levels floating in the sky or submerged in deep water. Your primary goal is to find a lost spark of light\u2014a glowing companion that acts as the key to unlocking the portal to the next challenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guided by a unique layered music system that swells and builds as you draw closer to your objective, the journey is one of discovery and flow. &quot;Just Balls&quot; is built on a single core principle: movement that feels good. Every element is designed to create a relaxing yet engaging experience, from the custom water buoyancy that invites you to explore its depths, to the springy bounce pads that launch you into the sky. It\u2019s a game designed to be picked up and enjoyed at your own pace.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037610/extras/4981149ad092aea0550daf6c498e248c.poster.avif?t=1759177845\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037610/extras/4981149ad092aea0550daf6c498e248c.webm?t=1759177845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037610/extras/4981149ad092aea0550daf6c498e248c.mp4?t=1759177845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Based Freedom:</strong> Master a fine-tuned control scheme that makes simply moving a joy. Chain together sprints, dashes, jumps and some gravity boosting to find your own path through each level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World of Spheres:</strong> Explore dozens of handcrafted levels across multiple distinct worlds, each with its own theme, challenges, and unique feel\u2014from serene floating islands to complex underwater mazes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Layered Soundtrack:</strong> Let the music be your guide. An interactive score adds layers and intensity helping you find your goal, making discovery an auditory experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Collectibles:</strong> Seek out and shatter fragile shells to find the glowing fragments hidden inside. Fully completing levels allows you to witness an ever-changing, physics-based sculpture grow and evolve in your hub world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Gameplay Elements:</strong> Use bounce pads for verticality, ride  ramps for speed, float up with streams of bubbles, and navigate moving platforms on your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Photo Mode:</strong> Found a perfect moment? Pause the action and use the built-in photo mode to capture the minimalist beauty of your adventure.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037610/extras/f2638d286db26664e9aa8b738292ca5c.poster.avif?t=1759177845\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037610/extras/f2638d286db26664e9aa8b738292ca5c.webm?t=1759177845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037610/extras/f2638d286db26664e9aa8b738292ca5c.mp4?t=1759177845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>&quot;Just Balls&quot;</strong> is a solo developer passion project, born from a love for pure, satisfying gameplay. I hope you find as much joy and flow in playing it as I have in creating it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037610/extras/ad43466ec1b885b9eb972d62fbeb6642.poster.avif?t=1759177845\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037610/extras/ad43466ec1b885b9eb972d62fbeb6642.webm?t=1759177845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037610/extras/ad43466ec1b885b9eb972d62fbeb6642.mp4?t=1759177845\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4037610?t=1759177845","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037610/aa6a31d737450609bf11cf7cdc327474ada2b5cc/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759177845","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037610/cbfa559ae15738cf4362fd2358e4ee86d9743f66/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759177845","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037610/cbfa559ae15738cf4362fd2358e4ee86d9743f66/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759177845","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Camera Comfort","id":67},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"descri