_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Physics-Based Freedom:</strong> Master a fine-tuned control scheme that makes simply moving a joy. Chain together sprints, dashes, jumps and some gravity boosting to find your own path through each level.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World of Spheres:</strong> Explore dozens of handcrafted levels across multiple distinct worlds, each with its own theme, challenges, and unique feel\u2014from serene floating islands to complex underwater mazes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Layered Soundtrack:</strong> Let the music be your guide. An interactive score adds layers and intensity helping you find your goal, making discovery an auditory experience.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Engaging Collectibles:</strong> Seek out and shatter fragile shells to find the glowing fragments hidden inside. Fully completing levels allows you to witness an ever-changing, physics-based sculpture grow and evolve in your hub world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Diverse Gameplay Elements:</strong> Use bounce pads for verticality, ride  ramps for speed, float up with streams of bubbles, and navigate moving platforms on your journey.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Photo Mode:</strong> Found a perfect moment? Pause the action and use the built-in photo mode to capture the minimalist beauty of your adventure.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037610/extras/f2638d286db26664e9aa8b738292ca5c.poster.avif?t=1759177845\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4037610/extras/f2638d286db26664e9aa8b738292ca5c.webm?t=1759177845\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><